  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2451.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La cervecer&iacute;a El Gale&oacute;n de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado un vibrante concierto del grupo de punk rock La L&iacute;nea XYZ, con sus temas en castellano y valenciano muy reivindicativos y sociales.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2439.jpg\" alt=\"img_2439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2440.jpg\" alt=\"img_2440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2441.jpg\" alt=\"img_2441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2442.jpg\" alt=\"img_2442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2443.jpg\" alt=\"img_2443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2444.jpg\" alt=\"img_2444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2445.jpg\" alt=\"img_2445\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2446.jpg\" alt=\"img_2446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2447.jpg\" alt=\"img_2447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lalineaxyzgaleon/img_2448.jpg\" alt=\"img_2448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /